1400 REM --------------------------------
1401 REM SELL
1402 REM --------------------------------
1410 INPUT "SELL WHICH GOOD (1-8)? ";gi
1420 IF gi<1 OR gi>8 THEN GO TO 1200
1430 INPUT "HOW MANY TONS? ";nt
