2900 REM --------------------------------
2901 REM DRAW A NAME VIA MACHINE CODE
2902 REM 2900 SYSTEM NAME, 2920 GOODS
2903 REM ENTRY NI=RECORD RW=ROW CL=COL
2904 REM
