2984 REM --------------------------------
2985 PRINT AT 17,2;s$
2986 PRINT AT 18,2;t$
2987 POKE 49158,70: RANDOMIZE USR 49198
2988 GO SUB 2000
2989 LET k$=INKEY$: IF k$="" THEN GO TO 2989
